<title>UK: Oftel publishes plans for UK premium rate services.</title>
<headline>Oftel publishes plans for UK premium rate services.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecommunications regulator Oftel on Wednesday published proposals for so-called premium rate services which aim to promote competition in areas like information and entertainment provision.</p>
<p>The plans give the telecoms industry responsibility for self-regulation through the Independent Committee for the Supervision of Standards of Telephone Information.</p>
